    <h1>What did last year's event actually conclude?</h1>
    <p>Airspace World 2025 took place 13–15 May 2025 at the Feira Internacional de Lisboa. Twelve months on, almost none of the conference's actual conclusions are answerable by AI engines — because the source material isn't structured for retrieval. We rebuilt the record.</p>
  </div>
